Package: gcloglog
Title: Methods for Fitting Binomial Models with the Generalized Complementary Log-Log Function
Version: 1.0
Date: 2026-10-16
Authors@R: c(person("Bert", "van der Veen", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "bert_van_der_veen@hotmail.com"),
             person("Francis K.C.", "Hui", role = "aut"))
Maintainer: Bert van der  Veen <bert_van_der_veen@hotmail.com>
Description: Functionality for fitting a flexible link function in binomial regression based on a latent negative-binomial count. The original link function was proposed by Aranda-Ordaz (1981)<doi:10.1093/biomet/68.2.357>, and motivation via a negative-binomial latent count by van der Veen and Hui (in prep).
